From ac8c577569cecd81711a8a114432b607cefadb5b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian MacDonald <ian@netstatz.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Sep 2026 17:48:13 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 33/77] fix(cli): accept every non-default backend mode in
 lemonade pull --label

flm serves transcription and openmoss serves audio-generation beside
their default modes, but the pull allow-list rejected both labels, so a
user.* model of either kind could not be registered from the CLI. The
test now walks every backend descriptor's non-default modes instead of
checking tflite alone.

Assisted-by: claude:opus-5.5
---
 docs/guide/cli.md                         | 2 +-
 docs/guide/configuration/custom-models.md | 2 +-
 src/cpp/include/lemon_cli/pull_labels.h   | 2 ++
 3 files changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/docs/guide/cli.md b/docs/guide/cli.md
index c9f93c65e..d8397f181 100644
--- a/docs/guide/cli.md
+++ b/docs/guide/cli.md
@@ -201,7 +201,7 @@ lemonade pull user.MyModel --checkpoint main org/model:Q4_0 --recipe llamacpp --
 | `--alias ALIAS` | Add an alias for the model being registered or pulled. | No |
 | `--checkpoint TYPE CHECKPOINT` | Manual registration: add a checkpoint entry. Repeat for multi-component models such as `main` + `mmproj` or `main` + `vae`. | No |
 | `--recipe RECIPE` | Manual registration: recipe to associate with the new `user.*` model (`llamacpp`, `flm`, `ryzenai-llm`, `vllm`, `whispercpp`, `sd-cpp`, `kokoro`, `collection.omni`) | No |
-| `--label LABEL` | Manual registration: add a label to the new model. Repeatable. Valid: `chat`, `coding`, `dflash`, `embeddings`, `hot`, `image-classification`, `mtp`, `reasoning`, `reranking`, `tool-calling`, `vision` | No |
+| `--label LABEL` | Manual registration: add a label to the new model. Repeatable. Valid: `audio-generation`, `chat`, `coding`, `dflash`, `embeddings`, `hot`, `image-classification`, `mtp`, `reasoning`, `reranking`, `tool-calling`, `transcription`, `vision` | No |
 | `--components MODEL [MODEL ...]` | Omni-model registration: component names to bundle. Use with `--recipe collection.omni`. Components must already be registered (built-in or previously pulled `user.*`); any not-yet-downloaded components are pulled by the same call. | No |
 
 ## Options for alias
diff --git a/docs/guide/configuration/custom-models.md b/docs/guide/configuration/custom-models.md
index d6faccc5b..279888f5b 100644
--- a/docs/guide/configuration/custom-models.md
+++ b/docs/guide/configuration/custom-models.md
@@ -100,7 +100,7 @@ Supported registration flags:
 | `--source SOURCE` | Remote registry for every checkpoint in this model: <!-- BEGIN GENERATED: remote-registry-tokens -->`huggingface` or `modelscope`<!-- END GENERATED: remote-registry-tokens -->. When omitted, the server's configured `default_model_source` applies. |
 | `--checkpoint TYPE CHECKPOINT` | Add a checkpoint entry. Repeat for multi-file models such as `main` + `mmproj` or `main` + `vae`. |
 | `--recipe RECIPE` | Recipe to associate with the new `user.*` model. Common values: <!-- BEGIN GENERATED: recipe-values -->`llamacpp`, `llamacpp-hrx`, `whispercpp`, `moonshine`, `kokoro`, `sd-cpp`, `flm`, `ryzenai-llm`, `vllm`, `thenoise`, `ds4`, `thinksound`, `acestep`, `onnxruntime`, `trellis`, `openmoss`, `litert`, `tflite`, `executorch`, `collection.omni`<!-- END GENERATED: recipe-values -->. |
-| `--label LABEL` | Add a label to the new model. Repeatable. Valid labels include `chat`, `coding`, `dflash`, `embeddings`, `hot`, `image-classification`, `mtp`, `reasoning`, `reranking`, `tool-calling`, `vision`. When no [deployment label](../../api/openai.md#model-labels) is given, the recipe's default is added — `chat` for `llamacpp`, `flm`, `ryzenai-llm` and `vllm`; `transcription` for `whispercpp`; `image` for `sd-cpp`; `classification` for `tflite`, so a `tflite` image classifier needs `--label image-classification`; and so on. |
+| `--label LABEL` | Add a label to the new model. Repeatable. Valid labels include `audio-generation`, `chat`, `coding`, `dflash`, `embeddings`, `hot`, `image-classification`, `mtp`, `reasoning`, `reranking`, `tool-calling`, `transcription`, `vision`. When no [deployment label](../../api/openai.md#model-labels) is given, the recipe's default is added — `chat` for `llamacpp`, `flm`, `ryzenai-llm` and `vllm`; `transcription` for `whispercpp`; `image` for `sd-cpp`; `classification` for `tflite`, so a `tflite` image classifier needs `--label image-classification`; and so on. |
 | `--components MODEL [MODEL ...]` | Components for an omni collection (see below). Use with `--recipe collection.omni`. |
 
 ### Pull an Omni Collection
diff --git a/src/cpp/include/lemon_cli/pull_labels.h b/src/cpp/include/lemon_cli/pull_labels.h
